# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source archives
# Each app's ProPublic source ships as a git-archive zip of an upstream repo
# (notagroovebox/<app>) at a pinned commit. See docs/UPSTREAM.md for the
# commit each one corresponds to. Add them locally from the distribution;
# they are not stored in this repo (two exceed GitHub's 100 MB file limit).
*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audio assets
# Drum kits, pad WAVs and sample banks are large binary content and are
# excluded. The firmware, user guides and documentation live in the repo.
*.wav
*.WAV

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SD-card runtime data
# Pattern banks, kit definitions and the virtual Drumboy Pro's filesystem,
# written by the box as you play. In the Launch Boy image they live under
# System/File and System/Drumkit; everything outside those trees (firmware,
# samples, docs) is versioned normally.
Launch Boy With All Apps/System/
*.rwf
*.rwd
*.rwp
*.rwi
*.gbs
*.gbp
*.ins

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sync tooling state
.venv-drive/
.gdrive-cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
__MACOSX/
*.swp
*~
